 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "Roadworks. Red light. You're waiting next to the building site. Then: clunk. Something lands on your roof.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "It's the crane hook. And the crane driver thinks you're the bricks. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers think: floor it! Get out from under there!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "But your wheels are already in the air. The crane swings round. Faster and faster. You're a fairground ride.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "He puts you on the top floor. And the builders keep building. Walls. Windows. A roof. Your car now lives on the tenth floor.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Stay calm. Engine off. Hazard lights on.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "Then hold a sign out of the sunroof: I am not the bricks.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "The crane driver grabs his binoculars. Reads it. Oops.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "To say sorry, he gives you a lift. Gently. Over the whole queue.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "And puts you down at the front, just as the light turns green. Express lane.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: the ferry ramp closes, with you on it. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
